    "WITCHER.App.StatusEffectsEditor.Blurb": "Customize the combat statuses. Each card edits one status: its name, icon, description and the full RAW clause — stat &amp; roll modifiers, damage over time, action/defense locks, the auto-hit DC, the ending check, auto-clear, and periodic saves. Untouched statuses keep the built-in defaults. Saving reloads the world to apply.",
