    "WITCHER.App.UiCustomizer.ColorsNote": "Each colour drives one part of the whole interface (see its description). Tick to override; leave unticked to inherit. The swatch always shows the value in use, and the badge says where it comes from — a shipped default, the GM's World theme, or your own override.",
    "WITCHER.App.UiCustomizer.OverrideHint": "Override this colour",
