    "WITCHER.Effect.ActionAdrCostDeltaHint": "Signed integer added to the base STA cost of each adrenaline die spent. Negative = cheaper, positive = more expensive. Summed across all effects on the actor.",
    "WITCHER.Effect.ActionAdrCostDeltaLabel": "Δ STA per adrenaline die",
    "WITCHER.Effect.ActionClearHangover": "Clear hangover",
    "WITCHER.Effect.ActionClearHangoverHint": "Applying this effect immediately wipes every hangover the bearer is suffering. The source effect itself is left in place — let its duration or removal handle cleanup. Author it on a hair-of-the-dog tonic, a restorative meal, a cleric's invocation, etc.",
    "WITCHER.Effect.ActionDamage": "Deal damage each turn",
