    "WITCHER.Effect.CustomStatus.CountsAsHint": "Existing statuses this condition is treated as for resistance / immunity checks. A target immune to \"poisoned\" will also resist a custom \"spider-poison\" that counts-as poisoned. Ctrl / Shift click to multi-select.",
