    "WITCHER.Effect.CustomStatus.DotAblateArmorHint": "Erode this much stopping power off the armor at each DoT tick (Acid / corrosive statuses). 0 = no ablation.",
    "WITCHER.Effect.CustomStatus.DotAblateWeapon": "Ablate Weapon / turn",
