    "WITCHER.Effect.CustomStatus.EndKindSkill": "Skill check (DC)",
    "WITCHER.Effect.CustomStatus.EndKindStun": "Stun save",
    "WITCHER.Effect.CustomStatus.Hint": "Define an item-local status condition. When \"Make Status Condition\" is on + id set, this AE contributes stat / roll / restrict / DoT / auto-hit / ending-check / auto-clear mechanics under that id whenever it's on an actor. The condition is NOT registered in the world Status Effects list — it lives only on this AE. When multiple AEs on the same actor define the same id, the first found wins.",
    "WITCHER.Effect.CustomStatus.Id": "Status id",
    "WITCHER.Effect.CustomStatus.IdHint": "Lowercase, no spaces. Also stamped onto AE.statuses so the token shows this AE's icon as a status. If it matches an existing world status id, this AE's clause OVERRIDES the world one for the affected actor.",
    "WITCHER.Effect.CustomStatus.IncomingDC": "Incoming attacks auto-hit under DC",
    "WITCHER.Effect.CustomStatus.IncomingDCHint": "Attackers auto-hit this actor when their roll would otherwise fail to reach this DC — Prone / Paralyzed / Unconscious pattern. Leave blank for no auto-hit floor.",
