    "WITCHER.Mech.FumbleTable.armedDefense.Row5": "Your weapon ricochets back and hits you. Roll for location.",
    "WITCHER.Mech.FumbleTable.magic.Row0": "Magic sparks and crackles and you take 1 point of damage for every point you fumbled by, but the spell still goes off.",
    "WITCHER.Mech.FumbleTable.magic.Row1": "The magic that is already partially through you ignites inside you. Not only does the spell fail but you suffer an elemental fumble effect.",
    "WITCHER.Mech.FumbleTable.magic.Row2": "Your magic explodes with a catastrophic effect. Not only do you suffer an elemental fumble effect, but any focusing item you are carrying explodes as if it were a bomb ([[1d10]] damage, 2m radius).",
    "WITCHER.Mech.FumbleTable.meleeAttack.Row0": "Nothing happens — your strike misses cleanly.",
