    "WITCHER.Mech.Stress.Boon.Defiant.Effect": "You've had worse. Is this all they have? You roll twice and take the best result on your next mental break roll.",
    "WITCHER.Mech.Stress.Boon.Defiant.Name": "Defiant",
    "WITCHER.Mech.Stress.Boon.Determined.Effect": "You clear 4 STRESS. If in combat and below wound threshold, you ignore the penalties for 3 turns.",
    "WITCHER.Mech.Stress.Boon.Determined.Name": "Determined",
    "WITCHER.Mech.Stress.Boon.Focused.Effect": "You will have +1 WA for the rest of the day.",
    "WITCHER.Mech.Stress.Boon.Focused.Name": "Focused",
    "WITCHER.Mech.Stress.Boon.Hopeful.Effect": "There is a light at the end of the tunnel. Ignore the next 2d6 sources of STRESS.",
    "WITCHER.Mech.Stress.Boon.Hopeful.Name": "Hopeful",
    "WITCHER.Mech.Stress.Boon.Optimistic.Effect": "This isn't so bad. Clear 1 STRESS.",
    "WITCHER.Mech.Stress.Boon.Optimistic.Name": "Optimistic",
    "WITCHER.Mech.Stress.Boon.SmileAtDeath.Effect": "You make peace with your demise. Clear all STRESS. Ignore all wound penalties until the end of combat. You gain 2d6 temporary HP and 2d6 temporary STA. You gain +2 REF until the end of combat. When combat ends, you are automatically thrown back into death state.",
    "WITCHER.Mech.Stress.Boon.SmileAtDeath.Name": "Smile at Death",
    "WITCHER.Mech.Stress.Boon.Stalwart.Effect": "You clear 2 STRESS. You will survive this.",
    "WITCHER.Mech.Stress.Boon.Stalwart.Name": "Stalwart",
    "WITCHER.Mech.Stress.Boon.Stoic.Effect": "This is nothing to you. You ignore the next 1d6 points of STRESS.",
    "WITCHER.Mech.Stress.Boon.Stoic.Name": "Stoic",
    "WITCHER.Mech.Stress.Boon.Unbreakable.Effect": "All your STRESS is cleared. You are resolute. Nothing will stop you. You automatically pass 3 death saves if in combat, and ignore penalties from being below your wound threshold and death state for 3 turns.",
    "WITCHER.Mech.Stress.Boon.Unbreakable.Name": "Unbreakable",
    "WITCHER.Mech.Stress.Break.Depressive.Effect": "Nothing seems to matter that much anymore. What's the point. −2 WILL.",
    "WITCHER.Mech.Stress.Break.Depressive.Name": "Depressive",
    "WITCHER.Mech.Stress.Break.Impulsive.Effect": "Just do something. Anything. Not the time to think about it.",
    "WITCHER.Mech.Stress.Break.Impulsive.Name": "Impulsive",
    "WITCHER.Mech.Stress.Break.Indulgent.Effect": "This is too much. You need your vice. You need comfort. Eat food until you are gorged.",
    "WITCHER.Mech.Stress.Break.Indulgent.Name": "Indulgent",
    "WITCHER.Mech.Stress.Break.Paranoid.Effect": "Can you really trust anyone but yourself? Are you being watched? Something is out to get you. Isolate.",
    "WITCHER.Mech.Stress.Break.Paranoid.Name": "Paranoid",
    "WITCHER.Mech.Stress.Break.Scared.Effect": "You're in danger. Everything is uncertain. −1 to every roll.",
    "WITCHER.Mech.Stress.Break.Scared.Name": "Scared",
    "WITCHER.Mech.Stress.Break.SelfHarming.Effect": "Stupid, stupid, stupid. This is all your fault. You did this. Take 1d6 damage on a random body part.",
    "WITCHER.Mech.Stress.Break.SelfHarming.Name": "Self-Harming",
    "WITCHER.Mech.Stress.Break.Selfish.Effect": "This is not the time to think of others. You need to look out for yourself.",
    "WITCHER.Mech.Stress.Break.Selfish.Name": "Selfish",
    "WITCHER.Mech.Stress.Break.Violent.Effect": "You've had enough. Violence is the only answer. +1 REF for the immediate combat.",
    "WITCHER.Mech.Stress.Break.Violent.Name": "Violent",
    "WITCHER.Mech.Stress.Chat.BoonAbsorb": "<div style=\"border-left:3px solid {tint};padding:4px 8px\"><b>{name}</b> — <b>{boon}</b> absorbed <b>{absorbed}</b> STRESS<br><small>{detail}</small></div>",
    "WITCHER.Mech.Stress.Chat.CriticalRider": "<div class=\"wdm-attack-rider\" style=\"border-left:3px solid {tint}\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-brain\"></i> <strong>{name}</strong> · <strong>{label}</strong> critical wound — Stress <b>+{delta}</b>.</div>",
    "WITCHER.Mech.Stress.Chat.CriticalStandalone": "<div style=\"border-left:3px solid {tint};padding:4px 8px\"><b>{name}</b> — received <b>{label}</b> critical wound.<br>Stress <b>+{delta}</b> from the shock of the injury.</div>",
