    "WITCHER.Policy.CombatRoundReset.Chat.FastDrawNoAttack": "<em><strong>{name}</strong> ended their turn without attacking after a Fast Draw — RAW (Core p.165) requires the snap-draw to be followed by an attack with the drawn weapon. The Fast Draw status has been cleared; rule the move as the GM sees fit.</em>",
