    "WITCHER.Sheet.Spell.Tooltip.Edit": "Edit",
    "WITCHER.Sheet.Spell.Tooltip.ElementTheDamageCarriesUsedForPerTypeRes": "Element the damage carries — used for per-type resist / immunity lookups.",
    "WITCHER.Sheet.Spell.Tooltip.GeometryOfTheAreaOfEffectNoneSingleTarge": "Geometry of the area of effect. 'None' = single target.",
    "WITCHER.Sheet.Spell.Tooltip.NamedEntryInTheSpellHandlersRegistryModu": "Named entry in the SPELL_HANDLERS registry (module/mechanics/spellHandlers.mjs). When set, the cast flow invokes the handler at hook points so bespoke behavior can mutate the cast without schema-encoding it. Leave empty for pure schema.",
    "WITCHER.Sheet.Spell.Tooltip.NarrativeSpellsSkipEveryMechanicNoTarget": "Narrative spells skip every mechanic: no target selection, no defense contest, no zone creation, no auto-apply. Only the spellcasting check rolls and the effect description posts to chat. Use for spells whose behavior can't be schema-authored (cross-scene scrying, memory manipulation, complex GM adjudication).",
    "WITCHER.Sheet.Spell.Tooltip.NumberOfActionsTheCastTakes": "Number of actions the cast takes",
    "WITCHER.Sheet.Spell.Tooltip.OnlyMeaningfulWhenModeZoneTrueStatusIsRe": "Only meaningful when mode = 'zone'. TRUE = status is removed when the token walks OUT of the template (Yrden aura). FALSE = status persists for its own duration once applied (curse marker).",
    "WITCHER.Sheet.Spell.Tooltip.Quantity": "Quantity",
    "WITCHER.Sheet.Spell.Tooltip.Remove": "Remove",
    "WITCHER.Sheet.Spell.Tooltip.ScaleBaseSta": "The stamina cost at which this rider starts scaling. Set to 1 for scaling from the minimum cast. Set higher for 'every N beyond M' patterns — e.g. baseSta=2, stamina per step=2 gives scaling at 2 / 4 / 6 / 8 stamina.",
    "WITCHER.Sheet.Spell.Tooltip.ScaleMaxSta": "Ceiling on how much stamina can be poured into this scaling. Beyond this the rider stops growing. 0 = no per-rider ceiling (uses the spell's own stamina range).",
    "WITCHER.Sheet.Spell.Tooltip.SizeInMetersRadiusConeLengthCubeEdge0Sin": "Size in meters (radius, cone length, cube edge). 0 = single-target.",
    "WITCHER.Sheet.Spell.Tooltip.SpellWitcherSignPriestInvocation": "Spell / Witcher Sign / Priest Invocation",
    "WITCHER.Sheet.Spell.Tooltip.StaScalingFormula": "STA scaling. Formula: magnitude = offset * (1 + floor((sta - 1) / divisor)), clamped by cap. Errata Yrden { offset: -1, divisor: 2, cap: -4 }: at 1/3/5/7 STA → -1/-2/-3/-4. Sign follows offset (negative = penalty grows more negative; positive = bonus grows more positive). Leave 0/1/0 for no scaling (clause uses its static magnitude).",
    "WITCHER.Sheet.Spell.Tooltip.StaminaSpentToCastTheSpell": "Stamina spent to cast the spell",
    "WITCHER.Sheet.Spell.Tooltip.TangibleCastsFireRocksLightningIceImpact": "Tangible casts (fire, rocks, lightning, ice, impact) are absorbed by Active Shield / Quen — damage drains the shield HP first, and status riders are blocked. Intangible casts (suffocation, noxious fumes, mental effects) bypass the shield entirely.",
    "WITCHER.Sheet.Spell.Tooltip.TrueThePlacedTemplateStaysOnTheCanvasFor": "TRUE = the placed template STAYS on the canvas for the spell's duration. Zone-mode riders apply as tokens enter; strip as they leave (per rider config); combat-round tick decrements the duration and deletes the template at expiry. Yrden, Static Storm, Consecrate, Blaze of the Korath, Freshen Air. Leave OFF for one-shot AoEs (Aard, Igni, Bekker's Rockslide).",
    "WITCHER.Sheet.Spell.Tooltip.VariableCost": "The cost scales with the cast — the flow prompts for it (e.g. Dispel)",
    "WITCHER.Sheet.Spell.Tooltip.WhatResourceTheDamageDrainsHpByDefaultSt": "What resource the damage drains — HP by default; STA drain, armor ablation, weapon reliability, or a shield HP pool for the special cases.",
    "WITCHER.Sheet.Spell.Tooltip.WhenOnTheCastCopiesEveryAeAuthoredOnThis": "When ON, the cast copies every AE authored on THIS item (via the Effects tab of the sheet, native Foundry authoring) onto each hit target — or onto the caster for self-buffs. The spell's duration is stamped on each cloned AE unless the AE has its own duration. Ideal for simple stat/skill buffs (Sharpen Senses, Glamour, Freya's Bravery). Leave OFF for zones (they build AEs dynamically from riders) and one-shot damage spells (no AE to apply).",
    "WITCHER.Sheet.Spell.Tooltip.WhenOnTheCastIgnoresTheCasterSManuallyTa": "When ON, the cast IGNORES the caster's manually-targeted tokens and always uses the AoE template to pick who gets hit — anyone inside the template takes it, nobody else. Use for Signs (Yrden, Aard, Igni) and any zone/blast where the template IS the intent. Requires a mappable area shape (cone / radius / cube / line); OFF falls back to the standard target-driven path.",
    "WITCHER.Sheet.Valuable.Hint.ValuableName": "Valuable name",
    "WITCHER.Sheet.Valuable.Hint.VampireRelict": "Vampire, Relict…",
    "WITCHER.Sheet.Valuable.Hint.WhatThisItemIsWhereItCameFromWhatItSWort": "What this item is, where it came from, what it's worth…",
