    "WITCHER.Sheet.Spell.Tooltip.ApplyEvery": "How often the target-resource effect (Damage HP / Heal HP / Ablation) re-applies over the spell's duration. Instant = once on cast; the rest tick each turn/minute/hour/day until the duration ends. Duration accepts dice (e.g. 1d6).",
    "WITCHER.Sheet.Spell.Text.ResourceNoFeedbackWarning": "Heads up — the damage/heal and its duration run silently in the background: no icon or badge shows up on the target to say it's active, so the affected player (and you) get no on-screen sign of it. If you want them to actually see what's going on, add an Active Effect below — that's what carries a visible icon, name and description.",
